TerraCycle operates 20+ country footprint collecting hard-to-recycle waste (cigarette butts, mascara wands, multilayer packaging) through brand-sponsored free programs, Direct-to-Consumer Zero Waste Boxes, and Community Recycling Hubs. Serves 200+ million people; recycles billions of pieces annually. Loop reuse platform redesigns packaging to eliminate disposability while maintaining convenience. Compared to municipal landfilling, TerraCycle achieves 74% better environmental outcomes; vs. incineration, 70% lower carbon emissions. This model addresses municipal recycling infrastructure gaps by creating parallel collection pathways for excluded materials.